# An object still counts as standing where it was made when plain objects that hide nothing lie between it and its class's prototype, and the prototype of a class below is such an object once it has lost its own names. Out of sight an Animal is laid below the stripped prototype of Dog: it is a Dog. So the layouts of the classes above the class asked for are no strangers.
